== Attempt 2: proposing patch from failures of v1 ==
  diagnosis [dermatology_full]: The agent offered to escalate to clinic staff for further assistance, but escalation to staff is not a supported tool action.
  diagnosis [book_for_child]: The agent attempted to handle a request for an unregistered patient (child) by suggesting the user contact reception, but did not escalate to a human as required when unable to proceed due to lack of registration.
  change: edit R2 Only offer actions that are directly supported by the available tools. If a patient requests something you cannot do, politely explain the limitation and do not suggest unsupported actions or escalation unless the escalate_to_human tool is available.
  change: add R4 If you cannot verify a patient or cannot proceed due to registration or access issues, escalate to a human using the escalate_to_human tool.

